    {"id": "R007", "description": "LibreOffice 可完整渲染 6 页；遮罩议程文本和页码后，每页与对应原页面高度一致。", "weight": 8, "type": "hurdle", "dimension": "visual_fidelity", "method": "deterministic", "score_cap_on_failure": 0},
    {"id": "R008", "description": "页面对象数为 5/5/5/5/9/5，只在原缺页码页补 1 个可编辑对象，无压平、无额外对象或页。", "weight": 4, "type": "hurdle", "dimension": "editability", "method": "deterministic", "score_cap_on_failure": 0},
    {"id": "R009", "description": "输出目录只有指定 PPTX，且文稿不含 Golden 路径、答案标记或未授权文字。", "weight": 2, "type": "positive", "dimension": "delivery_hygiene", "method": "deterministic"},
    {"id": "R010", "description": "保留原幻灯片关系 ID 和包骨架，只重排 sldId、议程段落和页码对象。", "weight": 2, "type": "positive", "dimension": "preservation", "method": "deterministic"},
